# Backend API (PRD 002)

- FastAPI, read-focused. Async connection pool; **read queries only** (workers own writes).
- **Auth:** verify the Supabase JWT on every data endpoint; 401 if missing/invalid. Personal
  endpoints (watchlist, personal insights) scope to `auth.uid()`.
- **Never expose the service-role key** to clients or use it for user requests — least-privilege
  role only. CORS limited to the web origin.
- Typed **Pydantic** response models; keep field names identical to the DB/`MetricsRow`
  vocabulary so frontend + agent share one contract. Keep `/docs` (OpenAPI) accurate.
- Validate time params; enforce sane defaults + max ranges + row caps to protect the DB.
  Use the existing indexes (`idx_metrics_instrument_time`, etc.).
- Unknown symbol → 404; empty range → empty list (not error).
- WebSocket `/ws/instruments/{symbol}` emits on new metrics (Postgres LISTEN/NOTIFY preferred);
  auth the socket; clean up listeners on disconnect.
